{
  "_doc": [
    "THE PLANE-HOOK ISOMORPHISM ALLOWLIST — the accepted per-hook asymmetries across the installed",
    "planes, read by crates/busbar/tests/plane_isomorphism.rs (Assertion I2 of",
    "docs/design/BUSBAR-1.6.0.md THE DESIGN, §1).",
    "",
    "The test REFLECTS the actual Some/None of each installed &'static PlaneDecl (it does not re-read",
    "this file to decide the matrix). For every hook field where one plane is Some and a sibling is",
    "None, the None is FORBIDDEN unless it is declared here AND the named capability maps to a real",
    "cell in qa/capability-equality.json for that plane's ledger column(s). An undeclared asymmetric",
    "None is RED (a plane silently not doing what a sibling does). A declared row that is NOT actually",
    "an asymmetric None on the live decls is also RED (a stale exemption). Over- and under-count both",
    "fail, so the file cannot drift from the decls.",
    "",
    "Each row: { field, planes_none[], capability, reason }. `field` is a PlaneDecl Option hook;",
    "`planes_none` are the installed plane keys whose None is legitimate; `capability` is the",
    "qa/capability-equality.json capability whose cell contextualizes the absence; `reason` is the",
    "one-line argument a reviewer can disagree with. Voice is NOT installed in the binary/this test",
    "target (off-default, feature-gated), so its skeleton asymmetries are governed by the no-deferral",
    "gate + the ledger's voice pin, not by this reflection — see the test header."
  ],
  "asymmetries": [
    {
      "field": "start",
      "planes_none": [
        "mcp"
      ],
      "capability": "disposition",
      "reason": "the MCP plane runs no long-lived start-time task; only the A2A server plane starts a background loop"
    },
    {
      "field": "on_swap",
      "planes_none": [
        "a2a"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "endpoint hot-swap on generation change is an MCP-endpoint concern; the A2A plane swaps no per-endpoint object"
    },
    {
      "field": "parse_endpoint",
      "planes_none": [
        "a2a"
      ],
      "capability": "egress-auth",
      "reason": "the parse-endpoint hook lowers the MCP client-endpoint config grammar; the A2A plane has no such endpoint section"
    },
    {
      "field": "lower_endpoint",
      "planes_none": [
        "a2a"
      ],
      "capability": "egress-auth",
      "reason": "the lower-endpoint hook is the MCP client-endpoint lowering; the A2A plane lowers no endpoint config"
    },
    {
      "field": "build_runtime",
      "planes_none": [
        "a2a"
      ],
      "capability": "catalogue",
      "reason": "the A2A plane is delegation-only today and builds no per-generation runtime object; LLM and MCP each build one"
    },
    {
      "field": "card_signing_domain",
      "planes_none": [
        "mcp"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "agent-card signing identity is an A2A-only capability; the MCP plane issues no signed card"
    },
    {
      "field": "card_kid_prefix",
      "planes_none": [
        "mcp"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "the card key-id prefix is part of A2A-only agent-card signing; the MCP plane mints no card key"
    },
    {
      "field": "admin_routes",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "catalogue",
      "reason": "the voice plane's streams: is a singular section, not a named-definition map, so it has no per-registration admin surface to mount"
    },
    {
      "field": "openapi",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "catalogue",
      "reason": "the voice plane contributes no plane-owned OpenAPI path document; its duplex session ingress is not described as an OpenAPI fragment"
    },
    {
      "field": "config_validate",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "catalogue",
      "reason": "the voice streams: grammar is validated through parse_section/default_section, not a separate plane-owned config_validate hook"
    },
    {
      "field": "registry_contains",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "catalogue",
      "reason": "the voice plane keeps no named-registration registry to answer containment on; streams: is a singular section with no named stream defs"
    },
    {
      "field": "reresolve_gates",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "the voice plane pins no per-peer artifact (providers are operator-declared endpoints), so there are no container gates to re-resolve on a swap"
    },
    {
      "field": "retain_verify_gates",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "the voice plane retains no verify gates because it holds no pinned peer artifacts across generations"
    },
    {
      "field": "on_swap",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "endpoint hot-swap on generation change is an MCP-endpoint concern; the voice plane swaps no per-endpoint object, dialing an operator-configured provider socket"
    },
    {
      "field": "parse_endpoint",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "egress-auth",
      "reason": "the parse-endpoint hook lowers the MCP client-endpoint config grammar; the voice plane has no such per-endpoint config section"
    },
    {
      "field": "lower_endpoint",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "egress-auth",
      "reason": "the lower-endpoint hook is the MCP client-endpoint lowering; the voice plane lowers no endpoint config, dialing an operator-configured provider"
    },
    {
      "field": "card_signing_domain",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "agent-card signing identity is an A2A-only capability; the voice plane issues no signed card for a peer to verify"
    },
    {
      "field": "card_kid_prefix",
      "planes_none": [
        "streaming"
      ],
      "capability": "trust-pinning",
      "reason": "the card key-id prefix is part of A2A-only agent-card signing; the voice plane mints no card key"
    }
  ]
}
